            "startSeconds": 1947,
            "endSeconds": 2116,
            "summary": "Described difficulty obtaining adequate KN95/N95 masks as a staff member, noted only receiving a single-use N95 per week despite purchasing her own, and requested the district provide five KN95 masks per week to all staff through the end of the surge."
